    <briefdescription>
<para>Coordinates replica acknowledgments for write-concern enforcement. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The coordinator tracks pending writes by <ref refid="structthemis_1_1sharding_1_1_l_s_n" kindref="compound">LSN</ref> and blocks callers until the requested write concern is satisfied or times out. </para>
